{"server":"tw","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_06_end","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_06","title":"掙脫美夢","storyCode":"DV-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"0dadb3b8e6f92cd3a122aa87d7bd6625bedd19d217bc39195afe470f47fd7918","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......桑尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是自願的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩爾醫生，我不明白......您是在代表誰發言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接收到了訊息，不同於過去的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲，是不是頭又疼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身體沒有問題，赫默醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些未經允許的數據湧入了系統中樞。需要額外處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......數據？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......桑尼，我們都知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一場......冒險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果......難以預料，但這是我們的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數據傳輸中斷，系統判斷以上訊息的接收者應為桑尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩爾醫生，您說話的語氣就好像您是我們......不，躺在那裡的受試者之中的一員一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法確認上述假設。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數據來源未知，我只是感受到了它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是真的嗎，赫默醫生？摩爾醫生能聽到我們的同伴們的聲音？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喬伊絲，你選擇了感受這個詞語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，赫默醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢境的內容發生了變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法解析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神和平時差別好大......你是感受到悲傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"檢測到邊緣系統信號強烈波動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......戴拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴拉蕾德？你又想起了她......難道九號裝置和弗蘭克斯主任的實驗也有聯繫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動機，情感，而非邏輯聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生，我能感受到，這是我們的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的......選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼先生，假如我向你保證，我會盡一切努力讓所有錯誤都得到糾正，你是否願意暫時放過多蘿西·弗蘭克斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫默醫生，我們感激您一路上的幫助，更感激您為我們揭示了實驗的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我願意相信您會站在我們這邊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您真的能保證這個人不會重啟實驗嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可萬一她真的這麼做了，我會替你解決她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......實驗暫停，多蘿西沒有受傷，受試者們也正在逐漸恢復意識......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有些不敢相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請不必擔心，情緒起伏是正常現象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲，你醒得太及時了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒見過奧利維亞那麼生氣......我真怕她會不管多蘿西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是搞不明白，你為什麼能聽到受試者們的聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的意識是被多蘿西的“中樞”連在一起的，可你明明在外面，你到底是怎麼被捲進去的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說，九號裝置與“中樞”無關嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有效資訊不足，無法做出判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在夢醒的時候，我聽到了邁爾先生的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢醒的時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那場發生在走廊上的衝突？就連之前的戰鬥都沒能起到作用，為什麼那會喚醒你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過事情解決了就好，多虧了奧利維亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生做到了，符合預期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在想想......她變化真大啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛認識她的時候，她還是個......唔，就大學裡很常見的那種好學生，文靜靦腆，不太愛說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以上描述與我的記憶相符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛她逼問多蘿西又力保多蘿西的時候，我都快認不出她來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就彷彿看到了......另一個人的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏比卡研究員，你聯想的對象是否是塞雷婭主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼說出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可別告訴奧利維亞我說了這樣的話啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生並不會因此質疑你與她之間的友誼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是作為她的朋友，我也不想讓她在這麼麻煩的時刻想起不太愉快的往事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我也該繼續完成工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊......通訊還沒有恢復嗎？糟了，老闆那邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有姐姐，真不知道她會給我發多少消息......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗蘭克斯主任，麻煩你跟我一起離開實驗區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......請等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然實驗停了，他們一定不會讓這間實驗室留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一樣東西......我必須帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......照片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照片上這些都是拓荒者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這孩子是......你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫默醫生，我對桑尼說的話，都是真心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的母親，我所有的親人......曾經都是拓荒者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小就聽他們訴說自己的夢想，見過他們的奮鬥，也目睹過他們的掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他們的付出令我有機會去追逐我自己的夢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我所擁有的幸運......大多數拓荒者都不可能擁有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的家人們，他們現在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們之中的大多數都已經離開了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在我得到鑄鐵城理工大學的邀請，回城參加他們為極少數所謂“天才”舉辦的夏令營的時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一場天災摧毀了我母親所在的臨時基地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成為一名研究者......曾經也是她的夢想。可她再也沒能等到我得到獎學金，被破格錄取的好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定非常難過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默醫生，停下這個實驗，真的是正確的選擇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些拓荒者，那些被生活逼得走投無路的人們，他們或許明天就會遭遇厄運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我本可以救他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多蘿西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不必像我的親人們一樣，絕望地被沙暴吞噬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，為什麼要問我這樣的問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有我們的實驗，那個孩子在離開海頓一號實驗室之後根本活不了幾天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們救活了她，我甚至讓你照顧她的起居，她不僅能享受衣食無憂的生活，還能為推動科學進步做貢獻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比在荒野上因為礦石病而悄無聲息死去的孩子們，她是多麼幸運啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕爾維斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_531_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那麼信任你、器重你，你竟然......在這麼細枝末節的操作問題上指責我、指責科學本身？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個答案也不應該由我告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲提醒了我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便我永遠不會贊同你們......你的行為，我也不該用我的標準來評判一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被自我懷疑與不確定性折磨，難道不正是我們選擇的命運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為研究者，我們只能自己去找答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都佈置好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的人已經進入基地，正在靠近實驗區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，做好準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校先生，我明白現在已經有些遲了，請再給我一些時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"上校的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......克魯尼，你沒有告訴我，有其他人進入了基地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是指......那家醫藥企業？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不必擔心，他們是萊茵生命的合作方，我一定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"上校的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的保證沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"上校的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"結果——我們要的只有結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，只是一點小小的延遲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"上校的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有結果的話，至少別給我們惹麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"上校的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記住這句話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還要繼續行動嗎，斐爾迪南主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我並不認為眼前還有其他選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"替我接通特殊通訊頻道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......通訊？突然通了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......埃琳娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我一直都想聯繫您，可惜連不上......您收到我的資訊了嗎？我把基地裡發生的事情都寫進了簡報裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多蘿西......弗蘭克斯主任的實驗出了點意外，不過沒關係，我和赫默研究員處理好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有拓荒者，他們也被安撫好了，正在離開實驗區......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您知道？這麼快......不愧是您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做到了你該做的事，接下來會由其他人過來清理現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說防衛科的同事們？他們終於進來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......那我更放心了。我還在擔心實驗區儲存的那些遞質......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們知道該怎麼做，你可以撤出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任，我還是留下幫他們吧，除了多蘿西，基地裡只有我對實驗內容最熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，我此刻就在監控站，難道兩位主任還控制不了局面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是這個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就聽我的話，立刻撤出實驗基地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能問一下為什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別用這些沒有意義的提問浪費我的時間。馬上來監控室見我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，主任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼問題嗎，烏比卡研究員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主任......斐爾迪南讓我立刻撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤離？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬伊絲，你先去通知奧利維亞吧，防衛科的人就要到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鴞","speakerId":"avg_128_plosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢，要離開這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......主任的反應不太對勁。如果說......他並不知道多蘿西走到了哪一步，那他為什麼對實驗出的狀況毫不關心？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐爾迪南主任，埃琳娜小姐並未離開實驗區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否中斷計畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐爾迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們繼續。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人都撤出去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，領隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是什麼預防程序，大概是想給我們打什麼鎮定劑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也算是大鬧了一場，是吧，頭兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別忘了我說過的，等他們問起來，事情都是我做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，不會讓你一個人擔著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我叫桑尼·羅馬諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒問你姓名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你跟你們頭領說一聲，綁架的事情都是我的個人行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"右手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打完針以後，你們總該處理這件事了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事......烏比卡博士？你為什麼要撞我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要接受注射！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊茵防衛科成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"研究員，你妨礙了我們的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，你的注射器裡裝著的，是我的工作成果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需不需要我給你解釋下這東西的適用對象？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？他們不是你和赫默醫生的同事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......怎麼該相信的時候胡亂懷疑，該懷疑的時候這麼容易相信別人啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你手上的環也拿下來，快——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......緊急醫療環？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到他們給你注射才想起來，喬伊絲為什麼會醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療環，就是這東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發給你們的醫療環都被改造過，上面有和多蘿西實驗室裡的儀器類似的感受器，只要和遞質一接觸就會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得彙報給主任，從始至終都有人在背後利用......利用......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，通訊......通訊又斷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來......原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏比卡博士，你看起來怎麼像要哭了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哭？不，我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危機根本沒有解除，桑尼，你們的敵人從來都不是多蘿西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
